      "description": "<h3>Key Responsibilities</h3><ul><li><p>Identify and onboard new premium/key accounts within the assigned territory</p></li><li><p>Build and maintain strong relationships with existing key clients to ensure retention and satisfaction</p></li><li><p>Achieve monthly and quarterly sales targets for the premium product/service line</p></li><li><p>Conduct regular client visits, presentations, and product demonstrations</p></li><li><p>Understand client needs and recommend suitable premium offerings</p></li><li><p>Coordinate with internal teams (operations, support, logistics) to ensure smooth order fulfillment and service delivery</p></li><li><p>Track and report sales performance, market trends, and competitor activity</p></li><li><p>Resolve client queries and escalations promptly and professionally</p></li><li><p>Maintain accurate records of accounts, leads, and sales pipeline in CRM tools</p></li><li><p>Support senior sales staff in strategic account planning</p></li></ul><p></p>",
